WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're doing well
and, now,

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.004
let's get to the news.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.739
The Congressional Baseball Game

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:07.907
was last night

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:10.643
and the Republicans
beat the Democrats 13-12,

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:14.881
but only because Kyrsten Sinema
refused to tag anyone out.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.582
[ Laughter ]
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:19.819
was shown on TV at last night's
Congressional Baseball Game,

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.554
talking on the phone
in the stands.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.123
Even worse,
they caught her on the...

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.492
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.628
Joint Chiefs of Staff
Chairman General Mark Milley

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.364
publicly testified
before the House yesterday

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.165
and said that there's
a possibility

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:36.035
that al Qaeda or ISIS
could reconstitute

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:40.506
in Afghanistan
in the next six to 36 months.

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.309
Damn, and I thought
the Comcast guy was vague.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.811
"Yeah, we're sending
someone now.

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.479
He should arrive between April

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.648
and October 2023."

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.215
It was announced yesterday
that YouTube

00:00:50.215 --> 00:00:51.751
will remove the accounts
of several

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.419
well-known
anti-vaccine activists.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:54.787
So, if you want

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.023
anti-vaccine content,
all you have left is

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:59.492
Facebook, TV, radio, sports,

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.860
and airports.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.328
[ Laughter ]
According to a new poll,

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.897
42% of registered
Texas voters believe

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:07.733
that Governor Greg Abbott
deserves a third term.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.869
In fact, they think
he should be forced

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:13.406
to serve out the entire term,
whether he wants to or not.

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.242
In an interview yesterday,
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.711
publicly asked Brooklyn Nets
star Kyrie Irving

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:21.847
to get a coronavirus vaccine
for the upcoming NBA season.

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:23.349
Well, good luck with that.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.651
If I know Kyrie Irving,
he'd rather jump

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.353
off the edge of the Earth.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.687
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.687 --> 00:01:30.857
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
met yesterday

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.125
with actor Woody Harrelson.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.228
Pelosi said it was a frank
and productive discussion

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:37.630
and Harrelson said, "I did?"

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.232
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:42.435
According to a new survey,
nearly 60% of millennials

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:45.471
will attend a Friendsgiving
celebration this year.

00:01:45.471 --> 00:01:48.040
Also, Friendsmas and
Friendependence Day,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.542
and whatever else
keeps them away

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:52.245
from their weird,
anti-vaxx relatives.

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:55.014
According to a new survey,
more than 60% of Americans said

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:58.550
that they regret not spending
more time outdoors as a child.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:01.020
So, in a way, it's kind of good

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.822
I forgot my kids
at soccer today.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.491
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:08.027
The makers of Skittles
have announced they'll replace

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:10.496
the green apple flavor
with the original lime,

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:12.999
while the eaters of Skittles
have announced

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.634
that they thought those
were M&amp;M's.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.136
"Oh.
Oh, this is a terrible mistake."

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:18.504
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:21.774
the aviation ranking company
Skytrax this week

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.510
released its annual list
of the world's top 100 airlines

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.046
and Delta Airlines
received the highest rating

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:28.481
of any North American
air carrier,

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.083
while American Airlines
got an honorable mention

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.319
for Most Creative
Customer Service.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:35.922
[ Laughter ]
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

